, \"description\": \"Say how many hours food must last, or ask for a 6-hour warranty on goods (priced extra). We offer only units that meet what you state.\", \"tags\": [\"shelf life\", \"warranty\", \"certificate\"], \"examples\": [\"It must last at least 72 hours.\", \"Please include a 6-hour warranty.\"]}]}"}
