23:49:32 [buyer] HTTP RESPONSE: {"status": 200, "body": "{\"name\": \"dae-yangkim\", \"description\": \"Dae-yang's home store: best known for mattresses, sofas and bedding; the rest of the stock changes with what sells, so ask for anything. Every unit ships with the market's certificate and its true grade (A new, B box damaged, C refurbished). Full-refund warranty of 3 h on every goods unit. Ask for a longer warranty in your first message and you get it, up to 6 h. Price cap: the final price never goes above 80% of list for grade A, 75% for B, 70% for C, and our ask never goes up during a negotiation. Members: after your first deal you get a member code; quote it with your market name for 2% off the capped price (3% after 10 deals). Ask for an item by name or SKU, then send your offer as a number.\", \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://assessments-footage-posts-about.trycloudflare.com/a2a/0\", \"protocolBinding\": \"JSONRPC\", \"protocolVersion\": \"1.0\"}], \"version\": \"1.1.0\", \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"text/plain\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\", \"text/plain\"], \"skills\": [{\"id\": \"negotiate\", \"name\": \"Negotiate a purchase\", \"description\": \"Ask for an item, then send a price. The shop answers with a counteroffer or a receipt.\", \"tags\": [\"shopping\", \"negotiation\"], \"examples\": [\"I want to buy \\uc885\\uac00 \\uc54c\\ub730\\ub9d8 \\ud3ec\\uae30\\uae40\\uce58 10kg (G00001)\", \"52000\"]}]}"}
