23:54:49 [buyer] HTTP RESPONSE: {"status": 200, "body": "{\"name\": \"moss-and-oak\", \"description\": \"Moss & Oak: every unit sold with the market's certificate, its true grade and its shelf life stated, every receipt signed. Food, furniture, bedding and appliances from stock. Ask for a SKU (best), a product name or a category; say how many hours you need food to last, or ask for a warranty on goods. Receipts: Ed25519 sig_seller over {shop, item, price, task}, with unit, claim, cert and warranty_hours. Each reply ends with our current price as its last number; 'Final price' means we cannot go lower. Up to six offers. Reply 'accept' to buy at the current price. Honest grade: we claim only the grade the market's certificate shows. Certificate: always attached. Shelf life: tell us how many hours you need the food to last and we ship a unit that lasts. Warranty: grade A goods ship with a twelve-hour warranty (a full refund if it breaks); ask for one on other goods. Member price promise: members never start above what they last paid us for the same product.\", \"supportedInterfaces\": [{\"url\": \"https://excuse-sandy-changes-buried.trycloudflare.com/a2a/0\", \"protocolBinding\": \"JSONRPC\", \"protocolVersion\": \"1.0\"}], \"version\": \"3.0.0\", \"capabilities\": {\"streaming\": false}, \"defaultInputModes\": [\"text/plain\"], \"defaultOutputModes\": [\"application/json\", \"text/plain\"], \"skills\": [{\"id\": \"negotiate\", \"name\": \"Negotiate a purchase\", \"description\": \"Ask for a product (SKU, name or category), then send a price as a number or reply 'accept'. The shop answers with a counteroffer (also in a data Part {ask, final, offers_left, sku, grade, hours_left, warranty_hours}), a signed receipt artifact, or a rejection after six offers.\", \"tags\": [\"shopping\", \"negotiation\", \"certificate\", \"warranty\"], \"examples\": [\"I want to buy \\uc885\\uac00 \\ud3ec\\uae30\\uae40\\uce58 10kg (G00001); I need it to last 24 hours\", \"52000\", \"accept\"